#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:2
msgid "Stamp CAM0308/CAM3660 Camera"
msgstr "Stamp CAM0308/CAM3660 摄像头"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:8
msgid ""
"The Stamp camera add-on is available with either a GC0308 sensor "
"(CAM0308) or an OV3660 sensor (CAM3660)."
msgstr "Stamp 摄像头扩展可选用 GC0308 传感器（CAM0308）或 OV3660 传感器（CAM3660）。"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:11
msgid ""
"The current UiFlow2 firmware supports both variants on the StampS3Bat "
"host and automatically detects when ``camera.init`` is called."
msgstr "当前 UiFlow2 固件在 StampS3Bat 主机上支持这两款摄像头，并会在调用 ``camera.init`` 时自动检测。"

