#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:47
msgid ""
"The camera wiring and power-control configuration in the current firmware"
" is specific to the StampS3Bat controller. Attach the camera add-on "
"before initializing the camera."
msgstr "当前固件中的摄像头接线和电源控制配置针对 StampS3Bat 控制器。初始化摄像头前，请先连接摄像头扩展。"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:52
msgid "UiFlow2 Example"
msgstr "UiFlow2 应用示例"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:55 ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:77
msgid "Capture and draw on an image"
msgstr "拍摄图像并进行绘制"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:57
msgid ""
"Open the |cam0308_image_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2. The example "
"initializes the camera at QVGA/RGB565, captures one frame, draws text and"
" shapes on it, and prints the image dimensions and format."
msgstr ""
"在 UiFlow2 中打开 |cam0308_image_example.m5f2| 项目。该示例以 QVGA/RGB565 "
"初始化摄像头，拍摄一帧图像，在图像上绘制文本和图形，并打印图像尺寸及格式。"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:61
msgid "|cam0308_image_example.png|"
msgstr "|cam0308_image_example.png|"

#: ../../source/refs/stamp.cam0308.ref:11
msgid "cam0308_image_example.png"
msgstr "cam0308_image_example.png"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:64 ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:84
msgid "Wi-Fi video streaming with QR recognition"
msgstr "通过 Wi-Fi 进行视频流传输并识别二维码"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:66
msgid ""
"Open the |cam0308_video_streaming_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2. "
"Replace the Wi-Fi SSID and password in the project, then open the printed"
" device IP address on port 8080 in a browser. The stream includes QR-code"
" recognition results when a QR code is visible."
msgstr ""
"在 UiFlow2 中打开 |cam0308_video_streaming_example.m5f2| 项目。在项目中替换 Wi-Fi SSID"
" 和密码，然后在浏览器中打开打印出的设备 IP 地址的 8080 端口。当画面中出现二维码时，视频流会包含二维码识别结果。"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:71
msgid "|cam0308_video_streaming_example.png|"
msgstr "|cam0308_video_streaming_example.png|"

#: ../../source/refs/stamp.cam0308.ref:13
msgid "cam0308_video_streaming_example.png"
msgstr "cam0308_video_streaming_example.png"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:74
msgid "MicroPython Example"
msgstr "MicroPython 应用示例"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:86
msgid ""
"Set ``ssid`` and ``pwd`` in the example before running it. After the "
"board connects to Wi-Fi, visit ``http://<device-ip>:8080/`` to view the "
"MJPEG stream."
msgstr ""
"运行示例前，请设置其中的 ``ssid`` 和 ``pwd``。开发板连接 Wi-Fi 后，访问 ``http://<device-"
"ip>:8080/`` 查看 MJPEG 视频流。"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:94
msgid "API"
msgstr "API参考"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:96
msgid ""
"The camera add-on uses the shared ``camera`` module. See "
":doc:`../advanced/camera` for initialization, capture, frame-size, pixel "
"format, mirror, and flip APIs."
msgstr ""
"摄像头扩展使用共享的 ``camera`` 模块。初始化、拍摄、帧尺寸、像素格式、镜像和翻转 API 请参阅 "
":doc:`../advanced/camera`。"

#: ../../source/stamp/cam0308.rst:100
msgid ""
"The image returned by ``camera.snapshot()`` uses the shared ``image`` "
"module; see :doc:`../advanced/image` for image drawing and inspection "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"``camera.snapshot()`` 返回的图像使用共享的 ``image`` 模块；图像绘制和检查方法请参阅 "
":doc:`../advanced/image`。"

